# PARTSET: the humanoid body as DATA (D30). PS and PP rows; the output for the default knobs is pinned byte-identical by the harness (sha256).
# PS | set | part | x | y | z | w | d | h | colour | when      (a solid box in the 24 grid; x right, y depth (0 = front), z up)
# PP | set | pose | part | dx | dy | dz                       (moves one named part for that pose)
# x y z w d h are integers or sums of integers and these variables (the knobs, D30 step 2):
#   tx  left edge of the torso     bw  torso width (build 0, 1, 2 = 6, 8, 10)
#   lh  leg height (knob legs 3..7, default 5)     hx  left edge of the head     hw  head width (knob head 0, 1, 2 = 6, 8, 10)
# colour is #rrggbb or one of $skin $hair $gar $trim.
# when is optional, comma separated, all must hold:  mark=1   style=X   style!=X   (styles: short long mohawk masked clown none). Rows are emitted in file order: a later part draws over an earlier one.
PS | humanoid | legl  | tx+1    | 10 | 0     | 3    | 3 | lh | #15161a
PS | humanoid | legr  | tx+bw-4 | 10 | 0     | 3    | 3 | lh | #15161a
PS | humanoid | torso | tx      | 9  | lh    | bw   | 5 | 6 | $gar
PS | humanoid | chain | 10      | 8  | lh+3  | 4    | 1 | 1 | $trim | mark=1
PS | humanoid | head  | hx      | 9  | lh+6  | hw   | 5 | 6 | $hair | style=masked
PS | humanoid | head  | hx      | 9  | lh+6  | hw   | 5 | 6 | #f4f0e8 | style=clown
PS | humanoid | head  | hx      | 9  | lh+6  | hw   | 5 | 6 | $skin | style!=masked,style!=clown
PS | humanoid | eyel  | hx+2    | 8  | lh+9  | 1    | 1 | 1 | $trim | style=masked
PS | humanoid | eyel  | hx+2    | 8  | lh+9  | 1    | 1 | 1 | #15161a | style!=masked
PS | humanoid | eyer  | hx+5    | 8  | lh+9  | 1    | 1 | 1 | $trim | style=masked
PS | humanoid | eyer  | hx+5    | 8  | lh+9  | 1    | 1 | 1 | #15161a | style!=masked
PS | humanoid | nose  | hx+4    | 8  | lh+8  | 1    | 1 | 1 | #d62828 | style=clown
PS | humanoid | wigl  | hx-1    | 9  | lh+7  | 1    | 5 | 5 | $hair | style=clown
PS | humanoid | wigr  | hx+hw   | 9  | lh+7  | 1    | 5 | 5 | $hair | style=clown
PS | humanoid | wigt  | hx      | 9  | lh+12 | hw   | 5 | 2 | $hair | style=clown
PS | humanoid | hairt | hx      | 9  | lh+12 | hw   | 5 | 1 | $hair | style=short
PS | humanoid | hairb | hx      | 13 | lh+7  | hw   | 1 | 5 | $hair | style=short
PS | humanoid | hairt | hx      | 9  | lh+12 | hw   | 5 | 1 | $hair | style=long
PS | humanoid | hairb | hx-1    | 13 | lh+1  | hw+2 | 2 | 11 | $hair | style=long
PS | humanoid | hairl | hx-1    | 9  | lh+7  | 1    | 4 | 5 | $hair | style=long
PS | humanoid | hairr | hx+hw   | 9  | lh+7  | 1    | 4 | 5 | $hair | style=long
PS | humanoid | hairt | hx+3    | 9  | lh+12 | 2    | 5 | 3 | $hair | style=mohawk
PS | humanoid | armr  | tx+bw   | 10 | lh+2  | 2    | 3 | 4 | $gar
PS | humanoid | handr | tx+bw   | 10 | lh+1  | 2    | 3 | 1 | $skin
PS | humanoid | arml  | tx-2    | 10 | lh+2  | 2    | 3 | 4 | $gar
PS | humanoid | handl | tx-2    | 10 | lh+1  | 2    | 3 | 1 | $skin
PP | humanoid | attack | armr  | -1 | -6 | 2
PP | humanoid | attack | handr | -1 | -6 | 2
PP | humanoid | mine | armr  | -2 | -5 | 3
PP | humanoid | mine | handr | -2 | -5 | 3
PP | humanoid | mine | arml  | 2  | -5 | 3
PP | humanoid | mine | handl | 2  | -5 | 3
